 *   B[nk][nj] -> Buffer B(j, k)  with shape (nj, nk)
 *   C[nj][nl] -> Buffer C(l, j)  with shape (nl, nj)
 *   D[ni][nl] -> Buffer D(l, i)  with shape (nl, ni)
